    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>43604</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>食材はそろったんだね？
じゃあ、始めようか！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Have you got everything we need? Then let's get started!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>43904</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ごめんね、みんな。
私に、もう少しだけ
時間をちょうだい</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I'm sorry, everyone. I just need a bit more time to prepare myself.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>44168</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……頑張って、&lt;Ines&gt;</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...You can do this, Ines.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>45300</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>まずは、トマトと
ほうれん草を切るんだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>First, we need to chop the tomatoes and spinach.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>45984</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>痛〜〜〜ッ！
指切った!!</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ouch~! I cut my finger!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>46848</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ああ、お皿が!!
うぅっ、破片でまた指を……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Oh no, the plate!! Aww, I cut my finger of the edge...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>47472</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>落ち着いて！
トマトは逃げやしないよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>There's no need to panic! It's not like the tomatoes are going to run away or anything.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>47716</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Ines&gt;の
こんな苦戦は初めて見る……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>This is the first time I have ever seen Ines struggle...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>47716</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Shing&gt;、本当に
援護行動をしなくて
いいのか？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Shing, are you sure we should not provide backup?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>47844</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……大丈夫。
あんなに一生懸命な
&lt;Ines&gt;が負けるはずないよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...She'll be fine. Ines is giving it her all, there's no way she'd let this beat her.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>49192</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そうだよ。
母親は、どんな強敵にも
負けられないのさ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>That's right. A mother can stand up to any challenge.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>50040</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>できたわ『三色ピザ』！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It's done! I made a tricolor pizza!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>50284</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……ううん、かなりコゲコゲの
『四色ピザ』になっちゃった……</JapaneseText>
