    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>52012</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ママの……三色ピザ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Mommy's... pizza?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>16</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>53340</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……ちがう！
ママのピザは、こんな
ヘンな黒いのじゃないもんっ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...No it's not! Mommy's pizza isn't all weird and black!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>17</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>53660</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>…………ごめんなさい</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...I'm sorry.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>18</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>53988</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>こらッ！
&lt;Ines&gt;が一生懸命つくった
ピザを変なんて言うなッ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hey now! Don't say that, Ines worked really hard to make this for you!</EnglishText>
